{"id":"torrey:towers","source":"torrey","name":"Towers","slug":"towers","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Origin and antiquity of — Ge 11:4.","refs":[["Gen",11,4,11,4]]},{"text":"In cities. — Jdj 9:51.","refs":[["Judg",9,51,9,51]]},{"text":"On the walls of cities. — 2Ch 14:7; 26:9.","refs":[["2Chr",14,7,14,7],["2Chr",26,9,26,9]]},{"text":"In the forests. — 2Ch 27:4.","refs":[["2Chr",27,4,27,4]]},{"text":"In the deserts. — 2Ch 26:10.","refs":[["2Chr",26,10,26,10]]},{"text":"In vineyards. — Isa 5:2; Mt 21:33.","refs":[["Isa",5,2,5,2],["Matt",21,33,21,33]]},{"text":"Frequently very high — Isa 2:15.","refs":[["Isa",2,15,2,15]]},{"text":"Frequently strong and well fortified — Jdj 9:51; 2Ch 26:9.","refs":[["Judg",9,51,9,51],["2Chr",26,9,26,9]]},{"text":"Were used as armouries — Song 4:4.","refs":[["Song",4,4,4,4]]},{"text":"Were used as citadels in time of war — Jdj 9:51; Eze 27:11.","refs":[["Judg",9,51,9,51],["Ezek",27,11,27,11]]},{"text":"Watchmen posted on, in times of danger — 2Ki 9:17; Hab 2:1.","refs":[["2Kgs",9,17,9,17],["Hab",2,1,2,1]]},{"text":"Babel. — Ge 11:9.","refs":[["Gen",11,9,11,9]]},{"text":"Edar. — Ge 35:21.","refs":[["Gen",35,21,35,21]]},{"text":"Penuel. — Jdj 8:17.","refs":[["Judg",8,17,8,17]]},{"text":"Shechem. — Jdj 9:46.","refs":[["Judg",9,46,9,46]]},{"text":"Thebez. — Jdj 9:50,51.","refs":[["Judg",9,50,9,50],["Judg",9,51,9,51]]},{"text":"David. — Song 4:4.","refs":[["Song",4,4,4,4]]},{"text":"Lebanon. — Song 7:4.","refs":[["Song",7,4,7,4]]},{"text":"Of the furnaces. — Ne 3:11.","refs":[["Neh",3,11,3,11]]},{"text":"Meah. — Ne 12:39.","refs":[["Neh",12,39,12,39]]},{"text":"Jezreel. — 2Ki 9:17.","refs":[["2Kgs",9,17,9,17]]},{"text":"Hananeel. — Jer 31:38; Zec 14:10.","refs":[["Jer",31,38,31,38],["Zech",14,10,14,10]]},{"text":"Syene. — Eze 29:10; 30:6.","refs":[["Ezek",29,10,29,10],["Ezek",30,6,30,6]]},{"text":"Siloam. — Lu 13:4.","refs":[["Luke",13,4,13,4]]},{"text":"Of Jerusalem remarkable for number, strength, and beauty — Ps 48:12.","refs":[["Ps",4